{"record_type": "sources", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "sources": {"screenplay-index": {"owner": "short-drama-write", "artifact": "剧集/EP001/screenplay-index.jsonl"}, "characters": {"owner": "short-drama-assets", "artifact": "设定集/characters.jsonl"}}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-001", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC001-P01"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "记忆里最后一幕，是病床，和一屋子哭声。", "performance_cue": null, "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-002", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC001-D01"}, "speaker_display": "周薄森", "line_text": "江晨同志，欢迎加入我们文工团。", "performance_cue": "和气，公事公办", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-ZHOUBOSEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-ZHOUBOSEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-003", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC001-D02"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "报告周团，没问题。刚来报到，有点激动。", "performance_cue": "接得太快", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-004", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC001-D03"}, "speaker_display": "周薄森", "line_text": "新媒体这摊子，以后交给你。", "performance_cue": "语气轻，像在交代小事", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-ZHOUBOSEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-ZHOUBOSEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-005", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC001-D04"}, "speaker_display": "周薄森", "line_text": "不瞒你说，我们这一块，基本还是空白。", "performance_cue": "停半拍", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-ZHOUBOSEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-ZHOUBOSEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-006", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC001-D05"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "明白。我一定尽最大努力。", "performance_cue": "标准答案，眼睛已经亮了", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-007", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P02"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "十几个账号加起来，还没有账号数量多。", "performance_cue": null, "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-008", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-D01"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "这可是火箭军啊。", "performance_cue": "对着空办公室", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-009", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P04"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "榜首八千。我上一世刚起步那年，这个数字是它的一百倍。", "performance_cue": null, "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-010", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P05"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "不是这个单位差。是这个世界还没有人会做这件事。", "performance_cue": null, "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-011", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-D02"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "一片没人动过的地。", "performance_cue": "压着的兴奋", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-012", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-D03"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "画面我有，人我也有。", "performance_cue": "越说越快", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-013", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P08"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "我不懂音乐。连抄都抄不出来。", "performance_cue": null, "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-014", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P10"}, "speaker_display": "系统", "line_text": "绑定成功。", "performance_cue": null, "voice_identity_note": "装置的声音，不属于任何角色；完全无空间混响，与本集其他声音不共享房间感"}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-015", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P12"}, "speaker_display": "系统", "line_text": "任务——五天内，任意一个连队账号，粉丝一百万。", "performance_cue": null, "voice_identity_note": "装置的声音，不属于任何角色；完全无空间混响，与本集其他声音不共享房间感"}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-016", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-D04"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "五天？", "performance_cue": "声音发干", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-017", "channel": "VO", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-P14"}, "speaker_display": "系统", "line_text": "补充条款——任务失败，收回全部已授予能力，强制解绑。", "performance_cue": null, "voice_identity_note": "装置的声音，不属于任何角色；完全无空间混响，与本集其他声音不共享房间感"}
{"line_id": "VL-EP001-018", "channel": "sync", "source_ref": {"src": "screenplay-index", "record_id": "BLK-EP001-SC002-D05"}, "speaker_display": "江晨", "line_text": "那我现在会的这些，是借的。", "performance_cue": "几乎是气声", "character_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN"}, "voice_direction_ref": {"src": "characters", "record_id": "CHAR-JIANGCHEN", "field": "/voice_direction"}}
